## QA checklist (post-implement)

1. Filter bar on project Tasks and global `/tasks`; no breadcrumb when inactive.
2. `State is Complete` — only Complete; breadcrumb updates.
3. `State is not Complete` — Complete hidden.
4. Title `contains` / `starts with` / `is` — case-insensitive as specified.
5. Number with `T0053` / `53` and operators.
6. Compound AND and OR (left-to-right).
7. Clear restores list; Cancel without Apply preserves prior filter.
8. Unassigned global filter still works with list filter applied on top.
9. **Persistence:** set filter on Project A, different filter on Project B; navigate away and back — each keeps its own; reload preserves both.
10. **Global All vs Unassigned** keep independent stored filters.
11. Mobile: strip + modal usable.
12. DnD / sort / task edit still work on visible rows.

